            <a href="/zh/gpu" class="bt bt-p bt-sm">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10"/></svg>
              订购新 GPU            </a>
          </div>
        </header>

                <section class="vdw" id="vdw-gpu" data-type="gpu">
          <div class="vdw-head">
            <div class="vdw-head-l">
              <h3>部署 GPU 服务器</h3>
              <p>选择套餐和位置——从余额扣款，几分钟内就绪。</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          
          <div class="vdw-steps">
            <button type="button" class="vdw-step on" data-i="1"><span class="vdw-num">1</span><span class="vdw-lbl">选择套餐</span></button>
            <span class="vdw-sep"></span>
            <button type="button" class="vdw-step" data-i="2"><span class="vdw-num">2</span><span class="vdw-lbl">位置与选项</span></button>
          </div>

          <div class="vdw-pane on" data-step="1">
            <div class="vdw-plans" data-el="plans"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="vdw-pane" data-step="2">
            <div class="vdw-recap" data-el="recap"></div>

            <div class="vdw-lab">地区</div>
            <div class="vdw-locs" data-el="locs"></div>

            <div class="vdw-opts">
              <label class="vdw-f">
                <span>操作系统</span>
                <select data-el="os">
                                    <optgroup label="CUDA-ready">
                                        <option value="ubuntu-22-cuda" selected>Ubuntu 22.04 + CUDA 12.4</option>
                                        <option value="ubuntu-24-cuda">Ubuntu 24.04 + CUDA 12.6</option>
                                        <option value="debian-12-cuda">Debian 12 + CUDA 12.4</option>
                                        <option value="debian-13-cuda">Debian 13 + CUDA 12.6</option>
                                        <option value="alma-9-cuda">AlmaLinux 9 + CUDA 12.4</option>
                                      </optgroup>
                                    <optgroup label="Bare Linux (no CUDA)">
                                        <option value="ubuntu-22">Ubuntu 22.04 LTS</option>
                                        <option value="ubuntu-24">Ubuntu 24.04 LTS</option>
                                        <option value="debian-12">Debian 12</option>
                                        <option value="debian-13">Debian 13</option>
                                        <option value="alma-9">AlmaLinux 9</option>
                                        <option value="rocky-9">Rocky Linux 9</option>
                                      </optgroup>
                                    <optgroup label="Advanced">
                                        <option value="custom-iso">Custom ISO (upload later)</option>
                                      </optgroup>
                                  </select>
              </label>
              <div class="vdw-f">
                <span>计费周期</span>
                <div class="vdw-terms" data-el="terms">
                                    <button type="button" class="vdw-term on" data-m="1" data-served="1">1 个月</button>
                  <button type="button" class="vdw-term" data-m="3" data-served="3">3 个月<em>&minus;25%</em></button>
                  <button type="button" class="vdw-term" data-m="6" data-served="6">6 个月<em>&minus;35%</em></button>
                  <button type="button" class="vdw-term" data-m="12" data-served="12">12 个月<em>&minus;50%</em></button>
                </div>
                              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="vdw-creds">
              <div class="vdw-lab">登录名与密码</div>
              <div class="vdw-cred-row">
                <div class="vdw-cred-user"><span>用户名</span><b>root</b></div>
                <div class="vdw-cred-pw">
                  <input type="text" data-el="pw" class="vdw-input" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="设置或生成密码">
                  <button type="button" class="bt bt-o bt-sm" data-el="genpw">生成</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p class="vdw-hint">GPU 必填。生成一个强密码并立即复制。</p>
            </div>

                        <div class="vdw-ai" data-el="ai">
              <div class="vdw-lab">AI 配置 <span class="vdw-opt-tag">可选</span></div>
              <div class="vdw-ai-nocuda" data-el="aiNoCuda" hidden>AI 模板需要支持 CUDA 的操作系统。请在上方选择一个以预装软件栈和模型。</div>
              <div data-el="aiRegion">
                <div class="vdw-recipes" data-el="recipes"></div>
                <div class="vdw-ai-sum" data-el="aiSum"></div>
                <details class="vdw-det">
                  <summary>自定义——软件栈与模型</summary>
                  <div class="vdw-cust">
                    <div class="vdw-cust-col"><h6>软件栈</h6><div data-el="stacks"></div></div>
                    <div class="vdw-cust-col"><h6>预下载模型</h6><div data-el="models"></div></div>
                  </div>
                </details>
                <details class="vdw-det">
                  <summary>高级设置——HuggingFace 令牌、公共 HTTPS、自动关机</summary>
                  <div class="vdw-adv">
                    <label class="vdw-f"><span>HuggingFace token</span><input type="text" data-el="hf" class="vdw-input vdw-mono" placeholder="hf_..." spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off"></label>
                    <label class="vdw-f"><span>自动关机</span>
                      <select data-el="shut">
                        <option value="0">永不（手动）</option>
                        <option value="6">6 小时</option>
                        <option value="12">12 小时</option>
                        <option value="24">24 小时</option>
                        <option value="48">48 小时</option>
                        <option value="168">168 小时 (7天)</option>
                      </select>
                    </label>
                    <label class="vdw-check"><input type="checkbox" data-el="pub"> <span>公开 HTTPS 端点（Let&#039;s Encrypt + 反向代理）</span></label>
                  </div>
                </details>
                <div class="vdw-ai-warn" data-el="hfWarn" hidden>已选择受限模型——请在上方添加 HuggingFace 令牌，否则部署时将被跳过。</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="vdw-foot">
              <button type="button" class="bt bt-o bt-sm vdw-back" data-el="back">&larr; 返回</button>
              <div class="vdw-total" data-el="total"></div>
              <div class="vdw-act">
                <span class="vdw-msg" data-el="msg"></span>
                <button type="button" class="bt bt-p" data-el="btn">部署</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

